</b> — Focus?","b":"Monitoring, escalation, and follow-up decisions","c":"Professionalism & Surgical Competence"},{"id":"safetyc72a2d33","l":2,"f":"The hazard class that deals with <b>radiation, laser, furniture, floors, buildings and storage</b>","b":"keyed <b>physical (physiological in one version) hazard</b>","c":"Patient Assessment & Professional Conduct"},{"id":"safety5848b69e","l":2,"f":"Wrong knee listed, site not yet marked","b":"<b>time-out/verification with the team and the patient, then mark the correct site</b>","c":"Operative/Procedural Safety"},{"id":"safetycebd6be1","l":1,"f":"<b>Sign in</b> — When?","b":"Before induction of anesthesia","c":"Mastery Checklist"},{"id":"safetyb5964550","l":1,"f":"<b>Sign in</b> — What is done?","b":"Confirm patient identity, site, procedure, consent; <b>site marked?</b>; anesthesia &amp; pulse-oximeter check; allergies; airway; blood-loss risk","c":"Mastery Checklist"},{"id":"safety6d80edfd","l":1,"f":"<b>Time out</b> — When?","b":"Before skin incision","c":"Mastery Checklist"},{"id":"safety014a62a4","l":1,"f":"<b>Time out</b> — What is done?","b":"Team introduce themselves; confirm patient, site, procedure; <b>anticipated critical events</b>; antibiotic prophylaxis given; imaging displayed","c":"Mastery Checklist"},{"id":"safety6ddff07c","l":1,"f":"<b>Sign out</b> — When?","b":"Before the patient leaves the OR","c":"Mastery Checklist"},{"id":"safety97e262bc","l":1,"f":"<b>Sign out</b> — What is done?","b":"<b>Nurse confirms the procedure performed</b>; \"all instruments and sponges are out\" (counts); specimen labelling; equipment problems","c":"Mastery Checklist"}]}